'''Stink Arms'''{{Refn|[[:File:Mutant (2438).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name="Mutant Ray"/> is the [[Combinations (Classic)|combination]] of [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] and [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]]'s DNA. He cannot be accessed unless the faceplate of the [[Omnitrix]] is broken or by using the [[Biomnitrix]].{{Refn|group = note|name = fusions|[[Diamond Matter]], [[Heat Jaws]], and Stink Arms are three combinations which were originally created by a broken, [[Omnitrix (Original)|prototype Omnitrix]]. All three combinations are possible with the [[Biomnitrix]]. However, they might differ in aspects such as appearance, powers and weaknesses as there is no evidence that the broken prototype Omnitrix creates combinations the same way as the Biomnitrix.}}

==Appearance==
Stink Arms mostly resembles [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] with a few of [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly's]] characteristics. Four Arms' eyes are replaced by Stinkfly's eyestalks, and he has Stinkfly's tail and wings.

Stink Arms wears a shirt based on Stinkfly's suit and Four Arms' pants, and also wears the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his face much like Stinkfly.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow" position="left">
Mutant (457).png|Enhanced Strength
Mutant (504).png|Enhanced Jumping/Enhanced Reflexes
Mutant (550).png|Enhanced Durability
Mutant (694).png|Limited Flight
</gallery>
Being part-[[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]], Stink Arms has enhanced strength, enough to send the [[Mutant Frog]] flying by hitting it with a metal alligator from an establishment.

Being part-[[Lepidopterran (Classic)|Lepidopterran]], Stink Arms possesses limited flight, allowing him to hover above the ground and move quickly for a short amount of time. Stink Arms also has movable eyes that give him 360-degree vision, as well as a sharp tail.

Stink Arms has enhanced durability, jumping and reflexes.

==Weaknesses==
[[File:Mutant (530).png|thumb|218x218px|Weighted Flying]]
Stink Arms' huge mass makes it hard for him to fly properly, unable to reach high altitudes like [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]] and only managing to float and make small jumps.

Despite his enhanced strength, Stink Arms is not as strong as [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]]. For example, he was unable to lift the [[Mutant Frog]] for more than a few seconds.

