==Trivia==
*Stink Arms is the first combination alien in the [[Ben 10 (Franchise)|franchise]].
*Stink Arms' voice is the same as [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]]'s.
*Stink Arms can be created in ''[[DNA Lab]]'', along with many other combinations. He is the only combination from the show to appear in the game.
*Stink Arms was designed by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}

